- Story & Context: Kael stood at the intersection of Sector 4, his hand hovering over the override switch while the sirens wailed in the distance, his eyes wide as he felt the vibration of the city’s electricity surging through his boots. He whispered to the unresponsive controller, "The grid is a ghost that won't stop screaming," realizing that the song he was composing was slowly draining the life from the city’s power grid.
